@startuml shared_analysis_coverage
!theme cyborg
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
title How much of the session counts as coverage?
concise "Session" as session
concise "Window A" as windowA
concise "Window B" as windowB
concise "Window C" as windowC
concise "Window D" as windowD
concise "Window E" as windowE
concise "Window F" as windowF
concise "Audio blocks" as blocks
concise "Coverage (clipped union)" as coverage

@0
session is "before Start"
windowA is "accepted"
windowB is {-}
windowC is {-}
windowD is {-}
windowE is {-}
windowF is {-}
blocks is "complete"
coverage is {-}

@4
session is "session"
windowB is "accepted"
coverage is "covered"

@6
windowC is "accepted"

@8
windowA is {-}
windowD is "rejected"

@12
windowB is {-}

@14
windowC is {-}
coverage is "not covered"

@15
blocks is "gap"

@16
windowD is {-}

@17
blocks is "complete"

@18
windowE is "accepted"
coverage is "covered"

@20
windowF is "accepted"

@26
windowE is {-}

@28
session is "after Stop"
windowF is {-}
coverage is {-}

highlight 15 to 17 #3a2a2a : missing blocks
legend bottom
 Illustrative subset: P05 proposes 8 s windows updated every 1 s; windows are thinned for readability.
 Coverage = union of accepted window intervals clipped to the session bounds (Start at 4 s, Stop at 28 s):
 [4 s, 14 s] + [18 s, 28 s] = 20 s of 24 s = 83 %. Overlaps count once.
 Not window count x window length: 5 accepted x 8 s = 40 s would exceed the session.
 No window includes missing blocks, so Window D is rejected and the gap stays uncovered.
 Window A starts before Start; whether such warm-up windows are accepted is open (TICKET-192).
 Validity thresholds (>= 3 valid windows, >= 80 % coverage) are P07 proposals, not accepted values.
endlegend
@enduml
